Adzuki is a tall, lanky man who looks elven, with brown hair streaked through with black. He works for the [[Org/Hildebrandt Corporation/index|Hildebrandt Corporation]] and comes to its parties in full military regalia, a festive hat worn askew, and a long glaive across his back, wrapped in tinsel and hung with little dancing lights.

He can turn into a tool. As a wrench or a small drinks umbrella he can still talk, and he gets about by hopping and flopping along the ground. He is loud, glad of a fight, and comes to a party for the party.
